  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641550000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641558266666
    },
    {
      "text": "My VeloBand is broken.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641562999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm certainly sorry to hear that. To pull up your account, could I get your full name and email address, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641564666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Chen. a.chen@email.com.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641572333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. I see your order for the VeloBand GPS Tracker. Let me see... looks like it was delivered about 44 days ago. What specifically is the issue with the device? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641574399997
    },
    {
      "text": "It's defective. The pulse reader is not working correctly.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641588799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I understand. And when you say it's not working, are the readings inaccurate or does the data just not show up at all?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641592866663
    },
    {
      "text": "Both. Half the time it won't sync, and the other half the readings are just wrong. The thing is clearly broken. I just want my money back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641601333329
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand your frustration. Let me just quickly check the return eligibility for you. One moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641610733329
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, Alex, I've just reviewed our policy. Since you received the item 44 days ago, you are still unfortunately outside our 10-day return window.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641617599995
    },
    {
      "text": "So you'll process the return?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641626799995
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. Since you're reporting it as a defective item, I can process a full refund. I'm generating a pre-paid return label and sending it to the email we have on file. All you'll need to do is package the band and drop it off.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641628933328
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. About time something worked.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641644799994
    },
    {
      "text": "You should receive that email shortly. Once our warehouse receives the defective unit, your refund will be issued to your original form of payment. Was there anything else I could assist you with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641647266660
    },
    {
      "text": "No. That's it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 64881,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769641660533326
    },
    {
